<title>POLAND: BFK 96 NET SWINGS TO PROFIT IN DECEMBER.</title>
<headline>BFK 96 NET SWINGS TO PROFIT IN DECEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.25 vs   1.86 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.20 vs   2.68</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.75 vs   3.48</p>
<p> Sales		   24.41 vs  29.19</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    24.25 vs  11.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	47.79 vs  21.63</p>
<p> Operating profit    56.02 vs  40.44</p>
<p> Sales		  364.48 vs 319.07</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA (BFK).</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
